# Marketplays — Global

**Mechanics (source of truth):** `docs/marketplays_cursor_rules.md` **Section 1** (Global) + **Section 2** (Deployment). Quick map: **Section 10**.

**Sequencing / priority:** `docs/marketplays_launch_roadmap.md` (stabilise-and-ship; Phase 1 MVP journeys first; AI agents / Nice-to-Have out of scope until launch-ready). Doc map: `docs/COMPATIBILITY.md`.

**Auth:** Clerk per launch roadmap Conflicts — supersedes custom JWT/bcrypt for *authentication provider only*; keep server-side RBAC (buyer/seller/admin).

## Stack (do not substitute)
- Frontend: Next.js 15 App Router, shadcn/ui, Tailwind — `apps/web`
- Backend: FastAPI on Vercel Python — `apps/api`
- DB: Supabase (PostgreSQL + PostGIS)
- Payments: Stripe Connect (Separate Charges and Transfers)
- Mapping: Mapbox GL JS
- Hosting: Vercel (`marketplays-web` + `marketplays-api`); DNS: Cloudflare **DNS-only** (grey cloud)

## Conventions
- Money in DB = integer **pence**; format £ only in UI
- Booking status enum exact: `Pending_Payment`, `Confirmed`, `Live`, `Awaiting_Proof`, `Awaiting_Buyer_Review`, `Completed`, `Cancelled`, `Refunded`, `Disputed`, `Admin_Flagged`
- Category enum exact: `sports_club`, `gym`, `school`, `shop`, `cafe`, `festival`, `community_event`, `billboard`, `event_venue`
- Never commit secrets; Stripe secret / Supabase service role / Mapbox secret = server-only
- Marketing = light mode; logged-in dashboards = dark mode
- Deploy details: `docs/deployment.md`
